Q.
Problem Statement
Implement a program to find and display the maximum number out of the given three numbers.

Ans:
class Tester {
	public static void main(String[] args) {
		int n1=3,n2=4,n3=1;
		if(n1>n2 && n1>n3)
		{
		    System.out.println(n1);
		}
		else if(n2>n1 && n2>n3)
		{
		    System.out.println(n2);
		}
	     else
		{
		    System.out.println(n3);
		}
	}
}
